,"start":88,"end":89,"surface":"卒"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xietiao-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","quote":"朓及殷叡素與梁武以文章相得，帝以大女永興公主適叡子鈞，第二女永世公主適朓子謨。及帝爲雍州，二女並暫隨母向州。及武帝即位，二主始隨內還。武帝意薄謨，又以門單，欲更適張弘策子，弘策卒，又以與王志子諲。而謨不堪歎恨，爲書狀如詩贈主。主以呈帝，甚蒙矜歎，而婦終不得還。尋用謨爲信安縣，稍遷王府諮議。時以爲沈約早與朓善，爲制此書雲。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0086"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"死者為父張弘策，公主婚議涉及其未名子。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian:p001:m0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"弘策","person_id":"0lf_ggf_5xo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段有明名或字。","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian"},{"start":81,"end":84,"surface":"張弘策","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0081","person_id":"0lf_ggf_5xo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作張弘策。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao"},{"start":86,"end":88,"surface":"弘策","id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008:m0086","person_id":"0lf_ggf_5xo","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作張弘策。","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao:p008","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xietiao"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian-father-0","subject_person_id":"0lf_ggf_5xo_A","object_person_id":"0lf_ggf_5xo","predicate":"father","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-034","source_id":"s-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian-ws1511900","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian:p001","quote":"張緬字元長，車騎將軍弘策子也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-034-wanggui-zhangmian:p001:m0000","obj